WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.906
Kip was building a nest for himself.

2
00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.213
"Do you want some help?" asked Bird.

3
00:00:11.214 --> 00:00:14.990
"I'm very good at making nests."

4
00:00:14.991 --> 00:00:18.018
"No thanks, Bird," said Kip.

5
00:00:18.019 --> 00:00:21.502
"I'm sure I can build this nest myself."

6
00:00:21.503 --> 00:00:26.137
Kip worked on his nest.

7
00:00:26.138 --> 00:00:31.235
He didn't really know how to build one.

8
00:00:31.236 --> 00:00:39.341
But he did the best he could.

9
00:00:39.342 --> 00:00:43.161
Soon the nest was finished.

10
00:00:43.162 --> 00:00:45.984
"All done!" said Kip.

11
00:00:45.985 --> 00:00:50.785
Kip slowly climbed into the nest. He

12
00:00:50.786 --> 00:00:53.463
carefully sat down. "Hmm,"

13
00:00:53.464 --> 00:01:01.247
said Kip. "This doesn't seem very—" Smash

14
00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:04.384
!

15
00:01:04.385 --> 00:01:07.371
"Squawk!" cried Bird.

16
00:01:07.372 --> 00:01:10.585
"Sorry, Bird," said Kip.

17
00:01:10.586 --> 00:01:14.222
"Why do you need a nest?" asked Bird.

18
00:01:14.223 --> 00:01:16.764
"Don't you like your hole?"

19
00:01:16.765 --> 00:01:19.985
"I love my hole," said Kip.

20
00:01:19.986 --> 00:01:23.714
"But . . . there's a problem."

21
00:01:23.715 --> 00:01:32.544
The two friends went up to the hole.

22
00:01:32.545 --> 00:01:35.879
Bird looked in and saw the problem.

23
00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:44.715
"Kip!" she cried. "Your hole is a mess!"

